Schwarzerblitz will be part of the IndieBreakdown tournament on the 12th December, 2020, 20:00 UTC! Here's what you need to know:

 The tournament will be played using the Steam version of the game, set in Tournament mode (options > game options > tourney mode). This mode contains only the stages and characters that are tournament legal;
 Tournament open to EU/NA/SA due to network reasons;
 All matches will be played through Parsec or Steam Remote Play;  a controller is required to ensure maximum compatibility. PLEASE be sure to test your setup before the day of the event;
 You will be required to join both the Schwarzerblitz Discord Server (link in the game's main menu or here) and the IndieBreakdown Discord server;
 Sign-up link on smash.gg


